WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:04.882
Start with a real business process: employee onboarding.

2
00:00:04.882 --> 00:00:10.850
We turn scattered inputs into a controlled workflow, then make every result easy to review.

3
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:16.232
Ask ChatGPT to turn the onboarding request into a structured checklist.

4
00:00:16.232 --> 00:00:21.143
Keep the policy explanation in Word and the approved inputs in Excel.

5
00:00:21.143 --> 00:00:25.353
Access requests and personal details need clear boundaries.

6
00:00:25.753 --> 00:00:29.603
Build separate approval and provisioning steps in n eight n.

7
00:00:29.603 --> 00:00:34.800
Inspect the payload, prevent duplicate requests, and expose missing information.

8
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:39.804
An email draft and a Notion checklist should reflect the same approved state.

9
00:00:40.204 --> 00:00:45.660
The same checked data becomes a Word brief, a PowerPoint summary, and an email draft.

10
00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:51.693
A shared dashboard makes onboarding workspace visible, with an owner and a clear next action.
